Hi Laura,

You're getting that error because the example code is outdated and ggplot doesn't have an opts() function anymore. To change the title you need to change opts() to labs().

Have you looked at the unmarked vignette for spatial data?

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/unmarked/vignettes/spp-dist.pdf

It's a really nice step-by-step for predicting rasters from unmarked models.

Ken

